WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.142
A volume gap for singularities.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.261
Smooth points have the largest normalized volume;

3
00:00:05.261 --> 00:00:07.370
singular points sit below a gap.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.873
Prove dimension four on its own, then

5
00:00:10.873 --> 00:00:12.945
deduce each dimension from the one below.

6
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:17.397
Claimed: the Spotti-Sun conjecture, in every dimension.

7
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.121
No Lean proof yet.
